  "description": "In this video released by the Coast Guard, Group Port Angeles, Wash., received a request for assistance from Clallam County Dispatch at 12:45 p.m. Tuesday, Oct. 21, 2008, for an injured logger one mile east from the mouth of the Quillayute River.  A Coast Guard MH-65 Dolphin helicopter crew from Air Station Port Angeles launched to airlift the injured logger. (U.S. Coast Guard/Air Station Port Angeles)",
